### Obtener disponibilidad de un staff member
GET http://localhost:3000/availabilities/ba937b4d-6748-11f0-b676-00ff1d8344ad

### Actualizar disponibilidad de un staff member
PUT http://localhost:3000/availabilities/ba937b4d-6748-11f0-b676-00ff1d8344ad
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "availability_days": [
    {
      "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY",
      "timeSlots": [
        {
            "startTime": "09:00",
            "endTime": "17:00"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dayOfWeek": "TUESDAY",
      "timeSlots": [
        {
            "startTime": "09:00",
            "endTime": "17:00"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
